      "id": "WS04",
      "kind": "static-derived-reuse",
      "finding": "World elevation, temperature, rainfall and hilliness are assigned before biome scoring. Rain and temperature are separate fields; hilliness is not solely an elevation bucket. Candidate biome requires implemented, generatesNaturally and layer permission; strict greater-than retains the earlier definition on ties. Prior27 covers four workers, not every competing biome.",
