    {
      "id": "WS05",
      "kind": "static-derived-and-xml",
      "finding": "New-game CanDoNext checks selectedTile.Valid and TileFinder.IsValidTileForNewSettlement, then tutorial permission; DoNext invokes a proximity confirmation helper. Settlement validator rejects canBuildBase=false, unimplemented biomes and Impassable hilliness, then checks existing/adjacent settlements and other map/site occupancy. Viewing a tile does not prove settlement eligibility. Core Ocean/Lake explicitly cannotBuildBase.",
