      "finding": "Region conditions affect local map settings: hilliness changes the elevation generator and mineable scatter base rate; biome changes terrain/plants and can force rock types. NaturalRockTypesIn otherwise seeds its temporary RNG from tile hash and samples2..3 eligible natural rocks. This does not establish all local terrain/ore layouts or guarantee exact resource amounts.",
