    {
      "id": "WS07",
      "kind": "prior-native-observation",
      "finding": "Prior28 clicked five existing-world land tiles and read Terrain/Planet UI: Desert, Temperate forest and Boreal forest; Flat, Mountainous and Impassable. Seed whip and coverage50% agree with saved metadata. It did not create a world, confirm a starting settlement or generate a local map, and did not prove same-seed equivalence. No native process is launched for this v35 index.",
