      "id": "WS08",
      "kind": "static-derived-reuse",
      "finding": "World average climate and displayed growing season describe site tradeoffs, not guaranteed daily or room temperature and harvests. Prior climate/growth derivation distinguishes seasonal means, local temperature and biological plant limits. The five prior UI samples are observations, not a threshold fit.",
