      "id": "WS09",
      "kind": "project-adaptation",
      "finding": "Web v35 uses a48x24 equirectangular regional map sampled on a sphere, three supported biomes, ocean/impassable settlement rejection and independently derived local-map seeds for existing64x64x16 maps. Rule version plus worldSeed plus region ID is persistent provenance. Region parameters are authored provisional choices, not the original globe, all-biome scoring or RNG. No rivers, local ocean simulation, travel or multiple maps is asserted.",
